\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211  
\par }{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 If current output is lower than potential output, the resulting recessionary gap places pressure towards ________ on inflation, causing the short-run aggregate supply curve to shift downward.
\par 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 
