\par     }{\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 Question No: 49    ( Marks: 3 ) 
