\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211  }{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 Give an account of different components of aggregate demand?}{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211 
\par }{\f1\cf0\highlight7\ulc0\insrsid4014471\charrsid11036535 Solution:-}{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4014471 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4014471 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4014471\charrsid4014471 Aggregate demand is divided into four components:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\b\insrsid4014471\charrsid4014471 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\faauto\ls2\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid4014471 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4014471\charrsid4014471 Consumption,
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\b\insrsid4014471\charrsid4014471 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}Investment,
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\b\insrsid4014471\charrsid4014471 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}Government purchases,
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\b\insrsid4014471\charrsid4014471 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}Net exports
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4014471 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4014471\charrsid4014471 
Investment is the most important of the components of aggregate demand that are sensitive to changes in the real interest rate. Consumption and net exports also respond to the real interest rate;
\par Aggregate Govt.\rquote s Net Demand = Consumption + Investment + Purchases + Exports
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4014471\charrsid5260211 
\par }{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211     }{\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 Question No: 51    ( Marks: 5 ) 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\b\f1\insrsid2125309\charrsid5260211 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 a.\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li360\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\tx360\faauto\ls1\rin0\lin360\itap0 {\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid2125309\charrsid5260211 
{\pict{\*\picprop\shplid1075{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 75}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLine}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}
