\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211  }{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 What does the slope of aggregate demand curve show?}{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\tx360\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11036535 {\b\f1\cf0\highlight7\ulc0\insrsid11036535\charrsid11036535 Solution:-}{\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11036535 
\par }{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11036535\charrsid11036535 
The slope of the aggregate demand curve tells us how sensitive current output is to a given change incurrent inflation. When current inflation rises, policy makers react by raising the real interest rate, which reduces consumption, investment, and net exp
orts. The result is a reduction in aggregate demand.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 b.\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li360\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\tx360\faauto\ls1\rin0\lin360\itap0\pararsid11036535 {\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 
In which situations aggregate demand curve will be flat and steep?}{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11036535 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\tx360\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11036535 {\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11036535 Solution:-
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11036535 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11036535\charrsid11036535 The aggregate demand curve will be relatively
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f10\insrsid11036535\charrsid11036535 \loch\af10\dbch\af0\hich\f10 \'d8\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\faauto\ls3\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid11036535 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11036535\charrsid11036535 
Flat if current output is very sensitive to inflation (a change in current inflation causes a large movement in current output)
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f10\insrsid11036535\charrsid11036535 \loch\af10\dbch\af0\hich\f10 \'d8\tab}Steep if current output is not very sensitive to inflation
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\tx360\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11036535 {\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11036535\charrsid5260211 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211     }{\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 Question No: 52    ( Marks: 5 ) 
