\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211  \'93}{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 Responsible fiscal policy is essential to the success of monetary policy\'94. Discuss.}{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211 
\par }{\f1\cf0\highlight7\ulc0\insrsid6317949\charrsid6317949 Solution:-}{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid6317949 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6317949 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid6317949\charrsid6317949 The monetary policy framework exists to resolve the ambiguities that arise in the course of the Central bank\rquote 
s work and also clarifies the likely responses when goals are
 in conflict with one another. In some cases the government sets an explicit numerical target for inflation, while in others the central bank defines the target Central bankers face the tradeoff between inflation and growth on a daily basis.
\par Fiscal policy control the government\rquote s tax and expenditure policies to stabilize output and inflation. }{\f0\insrsid6317949\charrsid6317949 
When the economy is sluggish, the government may cut taxes, leaving taxpayers with extra cash to spend and thereby increasing levels of consumption
. An increase in public-works spending may likewise pump cash into the economy, having an expansionary effect. Conversely, a decrease in government spending or an increase in taxes tends to cause the economy to contract.}{
\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid6317949\charrsid6317949 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid6317949\charrsid5260211 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211     }{\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5260211\charrsid5260211 Question No: 53    ( Marks: 5 ) 
\par }{\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid2125309\charrsid5260211 {\pict{\*\picprop\shplid1077{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 75}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLine}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}
